{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_033_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:bcdfc17b08cac1bec7c85b9f380b0250fdda38e92ad63a69627b50472c14d6cd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_a:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:644ef9856b08bc5a26deabaa782bcd01fa836c2669a6c200018f6eb3844aad06",
      "text": "太棒啦，是情人节巧克力！\n嘿嘿，谢啦●●●●プロデューサー♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3efd7839e071375db91c4d44dda916c1b061b570700820fb9e6fd1c29a1768fb",
      "text": "看起来超好吃的——！我现在就吃啰～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f30957dc5edfc96b5bea4fde80a563a9666f237304195f2935777bf499ae486",
      "text": "我开动啦——！\n嗯～，这不是超级好吃嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49aaf8e1a6f660d91415cbd9fbdc1dc860b76d41ff8b5f084099661acc368374",
      "text": "再来一个！好吃！\n感觉一转眼就要全吃光了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f6241c98f99eb956c81b2286efda81e290c15b88835013762d3fab6be83affe",
      "text": "待会儿的训练课我会好好努力的，再多给我点嘛。\n喂，可以吧●●●●プロデューサー！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a930a7a8358535eaab10a9031d2a0d285dbf106d3318008f8c69cc206b3c052",
      "text": "喔！你要给我巧克力？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:912b8cf98d30f4c9404cbec7fbaa1f71a0827fda09a11a8b0215c3eab8b01e84",
      "text": "谢啦，●●●●プロデューサー！\n这巧克力，看起来超级好吃的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94617e3c6d72977ef59b63ff028df61d41362f82fe43cc2a52cf8f8fa046e011",
      "text": "……说起来，我哥之前说过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98407dd47acdd0b50b224ddfd317318bb4c5e2c18e858042964938a43172d337",
      "text": "情人节巧克力好像有好多种含义\n对吧？这个算是什么巧克力？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000033:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e09c18092908f79d17423b2bec30b0b7825838a15f9b9f65d56e553e7944460",
      "text": "是Passion巧克力哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000034:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e51ede055bca38e7fff89361f2a8802a7bef59a4fad6bd8c7b3eb6f6f0eaf4af",
      "text": "是志狼君的专属巧克力哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:606a825a10c1ab83dd548bd47aa91a1d80b1de285b9acb3fb488329213aef3b1",
      "text": "感觉吃了就能像社长那样变强的巧克力啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cebd52e5ce73055dd4da22078b5e84f70cedb497e9f0b7af939720bb06447c44",
      "text": "我的专属？怪不得会这么好吃啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac1b3aa1988d82b0fed3d6c261464758d977859f2586c310f8a2e32476b1e0fe",
      "text": "好！剩下的等今天的训练课结束后再吃！\n人家都说运动之后吃甜点才算极品嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_033_22:5_01_033_22_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a3fcdc22d438d9e9cc8e2c3f324ea9c94ed42166fe1d4f41c3624c8c4058312",
      "text": "那我先去训练室了！\n你可别迟到哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
